  "//natural": "FANGS, NOT A MOUTHFUL: `biteRadius` 0.9 of gore.biteRadius, at the power a snake strike actually lands with (0.05..0.5 of the melee speed ramp), is a 0.15..0.25-voxel hole: a couple of art voxels into the limb. The bite block below is what the hole is filled with. `biteStain` 0.35 of the shared bite rim keeps the venom IN the puncture: at 1 (a zombie's ragged tear) the envenomed rewrite and the venom smear spread a wide green ring round a two-voxel hole.",
  "natural": [
    {
      "name": "jaws",
      "part": "head",
      "edge": {
        "from": [
          6.5,
          3,
          5
        ],
