          6.5,
          3,
          16
        ],
        "halfWidth": 7
      },
      "strike": {
        "blunt": 0.5,
        "bite": 4,
        "biteRadius": 0.9,
        "biteStain": 0.35
      }
    }
  ],
  "//bite": "WHAT THE FANGS CARRY: the bite tears a shallow hole (strike.biteRadius) and rewrites the exposed soft tissue to `infect` (envenomed, an infection material: materials.json `infect` block), smeared with the `stain` liquid (venom). The same BiteHit path a zombie uses with rotflesh / ichor.",
  "bite": {
    "infect": "envenomed",
    "stain": "venom"
  },
  "behavior": "snake",
  "//chase": "THE COBRA STANCE (MobDef::chaseClip, override + restFill). Within `chaseRange` voxels of a target it rears its front five segments into a swaying column and stares (the head-look between strokes, Mob::ApplyStrikeAim); it rises over `chaseRampMs`. A ground strike (snake_strike) drops it to coil low; the rear strike (snake_rear_strike, `fromStance`) is thrown from it.",
  "chaseClip": "snake_rear",
  "chaseRampMs": 450,
  "chaseRange": 20,
  "//states": "A SNAKE IS PRONE BY NATURE: `always` matches unconditionally, so the body is laid on the fitted ground plane (SettleClipOwnedBody) and every segment follows its own stretch of it (ConformProneSegments), the same two stages a legless zombie's crawl uses. bodyYOffset -0.65 lays it INTO the fitted plane: the prone placement holds a body's lowest collider corner half a voxel proud (kProneEmbedVox), which on a body 1.1 voxels thick is a snake hovering a hand above the ground (the snake gate measured 0.62..0.92 voxels of clearance at 0). airLift: a lunge's rise lifts the drawn body off the ground with its origin (the rear strike's leap), AnimStateRule::airLift.",
  "states": [
    {
      "name": "slither",
      "always": true,
      "disableGait": true,
      "groundAlign": 1,
      "speedScale": 1,
      "lungeScale": 1,
      "bodyYOffset": -0.65,
      "airLift": true
    }
  ],
